#. な、なんだべ…？
#. 俺が何かおかしな事言ったか？
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-What's wrong? Did I say something weird...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだべ…？
#. 俺が何かおかしな事言ったか？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-What's wrong? Did I say something weird...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンが大神さんを殴打したのは確かだ。
#. だけど、事件はそれだけじゃ終わらなかったんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro hit Sakura, that's for sure. But this doesn't end\n"
"there...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンが大神さんを殴打したのは確かだ。
#. だけど、事件はそれだけじゃ終わらなかったんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro hit Sakura, that's for sure. But this doesn't end\n"
"there...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その根拠となるのは…彼女の頭の傷だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's something that proves that—the wounds on her\n"
"head!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
